        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 26,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "For he has brought down those who dwell on high, the lofty city. He lays it low. He lays it low even to the ground. He brings it even to the dust.",
      "ko": "높은데 거하는 자를 낮추시며 솟은 성을 헐어 땅에 엎으시되 진토에 미치게 하셨도다",
      "source_text_hash": "1fd7ad07205588283d97c7a52259d978be9ee9ad9b278b9a3119384d4962e9eb",
      "translation_text_hash": "d7ac87cde62cfd75428789465e4a405da12a76c18899149cd73c7aa0ab5ce0b4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "높은데 거하는 자를 낮추시며 솟은 성을 헐어 땅에 엎으시되 진토에 미치게 하셨도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "d7ac87cde62cfd75428789465e4a405da12a76c18899149cd73c7aa0ab5ce0b4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ISA:26:6",
      "sequence": 18137,
      "chapter_label": "ISA 26",
      "verse_label": "6",
      "locator": {
